{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>יפלא</b> Twice in the Masorah, both defective — here and the other in Arakhin. For we learn vows from Arakhin: just as there, 'as your valuation, O priest, so shall it be,' so too with vows, everything depends on the sage — if it seems right to him, he permits; if not, he does not permit."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:11.742646446Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}